  <div>
    <h2>Dr. Saad Torki</h2>
    <p class=3D"author-role">Associate Professor of Applied Linguistics</p>
    <p>Dr. Saad Torki is an Associate Professor of Applied Linguistics. He =
has been involved in English Language Teaching (ELT) for over four decades,=
 working at undergraduate, graduate and postgraduate levels. He has authore=
d several scholarly publications.</p>
    <p>His academic interests include the teaching of the four language ski=
lls, readability, phonetics, phonology, teacher training, materials develop=
ment, the use of technology in language learning and teaching, and literatu=
re.</p>
  </div>
</div>

